<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17437" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλίσκος</span></b> , ὁ,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλός</span> I.<i><span class="en">
			2
		</span></i>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small reed, pipe,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιγύφθογγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					241
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλίσκων ὑπὸ λωτίνων</span>
			cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Parth.</u>
				2.14
			</span></i>: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυσᾷ οὐ σμικροῖσιν
				αὐλίσκοις</span> makes a great bluster, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				768
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally,
				<i>small pipe</i> or <i>tube,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				68.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				27.11.2
			</span></i>, Mnesith. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.38.3
			</span></i>; <i>catheter,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				1.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὶδοῖον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				187
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.582
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i><i>in Ptol.Tetr.</i><i><span class="en">
				157
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>ear-ring</i> (<span class="entity">Persian</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
